{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded out of time, your skills as a blacksmith are the only thing standing between survival and death. Pulled into a medieval kingdom by mysterious stones, you must craft, automate, and endure \u2014 alone or with friends \u2014 to fulfill the crown\u2019s orders and uncover the way home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/extras/adac4dd10bcc53c6e25202fc7489833b.avif?t=1758987527\" width=373 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surge of ancient stones tears you from your world and drops you into a medieval kingdom. Alone, unarmed, and out of place, you must survive \u2014 and the crown has a plan: fulfill their orders, and they promise the way home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/extras/ba019f76be3085b07512d25052f9c258.avif?t=1758987527\" width=373 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with scraps, fire, and sheer skill. Smelt metals, craft weapons, and build your first forge. Then expand into automation: coal, steam, and electricity power hammers, furnaces, crafters and belts. Optimize your workflow, design production lines and push the limits of medieval industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/extras/6eccfa4638d7c7022da8d9880c149b15.poster.avif?t=1758987527\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/extras/6eccfa4638d7c7022da8d9880c149b15.webm?t=1758987527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/extras/6eccfa4638d7c7022da8d9880c149b15.mp4?t=1758987527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/extras/4b09a35d8673db8087446a115c4a10df.avif?t=1758987527\" width=373 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Royal contracts are your lifeline. Craft swords, armor, and siege engines to earn favor and unlock the secrets of the stones. Complete them efficiently, scale your production, and get one step closer to going home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/extras/e1fb841e04db1b735326d8ef908e2536.avif?t=1758987527\" width=373 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or join friends online. Share resources, divide tasks, and build massive workshops together. The bigger your team, the faster you can scale \u2014 but watch out for chaos when orders pile up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/extras/06c1e6c735800269dfa34f0417bab47d.poster.avif?t=1758987527\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/extras/06c1e6c735800269dfa34f0417bab47d.webm?t=1758987527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/extras/06c1e6c735800269dfa34f0417bab47d.mp4?t=1758987527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/extras/16c87df4a36513f557d32af8b906b35f.avif?t=1758987527\" width=373 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The medieval frontier is unforgiving. Brave harsh weather, fend off wild animals. Every decision counts, neglect survival and even the best machines won\u2019t keep you alive.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1936750?t=1758987527","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/c60e872e383136cf06934082a421d05bbd4df2d1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758987527","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/825ab9f803fd745ead8e87d5d435ae166a5780e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758987527","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/825ab9f803fd745ead8e87d5d435ae166a5780e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758987527","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded out of time, your skills as a blacksmith are the only thing standing between survival and death. Pulled into a medieval kingdom by mysterious stones, you must craft, automate, and endure \u2014 alone or with friends \u2014 to fulfill the crown\u2019s orders and uncover the way home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/extras/adac4dd10bcc53c6e25202fc7489833b.avif?t=1758987527\" width=373 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surge of ancient stones tears you from your world and drops you into a medieval kingdom. Alone, unarmed, and out of place, you must survive \u2014 and the crown has a plan: fulfill their orders, and they promise the way home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/extras/ba019f76be3085b07512d25052f9c258.avif?t=1758987527\" width=373 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with scraps, fire, and sheer skill. Smelt metals, craft weapons, and build your first forge. Then expand into automation: coal, steam, and electricity power hammers, furnaces, crafters and belts. Optimize your workflow, design production lines and push the limits of medieval industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/extras/6eccfa4638d7c7022da8d9880c149b15.poster.avif?t=1758987527\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/extras/6eccfa4638d7c7022da8d9880c149b15.webm?t=1758987527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/extras/6eccfa4638d7c7022da8d9880c149b15.mp4?t=1758987527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/extras/4b09a35d8673db8087446a115c4a10df.avif?t=1758987527\" width=373 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Royal contracts are your lifeline. Craft swords, armor, and siege engines to earn favor and unlock the secrets of the stones. Complete them efficiently, scale your production, and get one step closer to going home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/extras/e1fb841e04db1b735326d8ef908e2536.avif?t=1758987527\" width=373 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or join friends online. Share resources, divide tasks, and build massive workshops together. The bigger your team, the faster you can scale \u2014 but watch out for chaos when orders pile up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/extras/06c1e6c735800269dfa34f0417bab47d.poster.avif?t=1758987527\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/extras/06c1e6c735800269dfa34f0417bab47d.webm?t=1758987527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/extras/06c1e6c735800269dfa34f0417bab47d.mp4?t=1758987527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/extras/16c87df4a36513f557d32af8b906b35f.avif?t=1758987527\" width=373 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The medieval frontier is unforgiving. Brave harsh weather, fend off wild animals. Every decision counts, neglect survival and even the best machines won\u2019t keep you alive.</p>","developers":["DevBre Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936750/d5747df8efd3d96bd3a1f15b7a151d1571ead